{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>The life of Sarah</b> — it is written above it: \"and Bethuel begot Rebecca\" (Genesis 22:23). Before the sun of Sarah set, the sun of Rebecca shone." "<b>שרה מאה שנה</b> — ראשי תיבות: שמש וזרח השמש ובא השמש." "<b>The years of Sarah's life</b> — it does not say \"the days of,\" because she returned to the days of her youth, and when she grew old again the days of youth ceased from her; therefore it says \"years.\" Another interpretation: From where \"and they were\"? The principal years of her life were from when Isaac was born — she was 90 when he was born, and all her days were 127."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:39.713351517Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}